---
description: Load Agent Skills from this repo's skills/ directory
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo is `cem-agent-hub`, a hub of Agent Skills following the agentskills.io standard.

- Own skills live under `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`.
- Vendored third-party skills live under `vendor/<org>/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`.
- Cursor only scans skill directories one level deep, so avoid relying on nested domain grouping here without also flattening or symlinking for Cursor.

When a task matches a skill's `description`, read the corresponding `SKILL.md` (and any `references/` files it points to) before acting.
